      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "街には、時々幻獣のウワサをしている人がいます。\r\n\r\nウワサを聞くと、世界地図に幻獣のすみかを示すマークが表示され\r\nその周辺に幻獣が生息していることがわかるようになります。\r\n\r\n幻獣と会うことができれば、力を貸してくれるかもしれません。\r\n世界中で幻獣のウワサを探してみましょう！",
        "official_en": "On your journey you may encounter townsfolk\r\ngossiping about espers.\r\n\r\nAfter hearing about an esper, their dwelling will\r\nbe marked on your map, indicating the general\r\narea where they can be found.\r\n\r\nBe sure to keep an ear out for these rumors—if\r\nyou happen upon an esper, they may agree to\r\nlend you their strength!",
        "real_en": "People in towns sometimes talk about Eidolons.\r\n\r\nWhen you hear a rumor, a marker showing the Eidolon’s dwelling appears on the world map, letting you know the area where it lives.\r\n\r\nIf you meet an Eidolon, it may lend you its strength. Listen for rumors of Eidolons around the world!"
      },
